+# Implement JSON Pointer (RFC 6901) resolvePointer
+
+Added `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` in `src/index.ts`. It returns the value the pointer refers to
+and throws when the pointer is invalid or does not resolve. Tests are in `test/pointer.test.ts` (run with
+`npm test`): the RFC 6901 section 5 examples, `~01` unescaping, falsy values, invalid syntax, unresolvable
+pointers, strict array indices and own-property-only lookup. Written test-first (red, then green).
+Decisions: see dl-001-json-pointer-resolution-semantics.
